PetBreed:
==========================================
- will be used as an abstract parent/super class 
  to the DogBreed and CatBreed child/subclasses. 
- used as a template to store common information 
  about a specific dog or cat breed
- demonstrates Abstraction and Inheritance
- use Encapsulation to control data access

Class Attributes
============
- sizes [small, medium, large]
- coats [hairless, short, medium, long]    

Attributes:
===============
- id                         
- type 
- name
- size 
- weight
- coat   
- energy        
- temperament
- lifespan

Behaviors:
=========
- displayProfile()  
      - can be overidden by child classes
      - demonstrates polymorphism

bg=green
</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>584</x><y>88</y><w>240</w><h>240</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>OOA- Understanding - Assumptions - Discussion

DogBreed
============================
- inhertis from PetBreed
- has extra size and coat class attribute variants 

Class Attributes
============
- sizes  [mini, giant]
- coats [double, wiry, smooth, rough]

Extra Attributes:
=========
- activities

Behaviors:
=========
- displayProfile()  
